    "long_instructions": "**To change the temperature, change what `turn` prints.**\r\n\r\n- `print(\"UP\")` will raise the temperature by one degree.\r\n- `print(\"DOWN\")` will lower the temperature by one degree.\r\n- `print(\"STAY\")` will keep the temperature the same.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Write a simple program that always turns the thermostat lower.",
